### POST Request to create or update Staff from landing on workspace page
PUT http://localhost:4999/sdec-ipaas-stub/api/v1/staff
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "pid": "1001",
  "name": "John Tester",
  "email": "j.tester@test.com",
  "enrollments": [
    {
        "team": "Child_Benefit",
        "role": "User"
    },
    {
        "team": "VAT",
        "role": "Manager"
    },
    {
        "team": "Customs",
        "role": "User"
    }
]
}
